                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR ANPASSUNG DER FRAME-LISTENPERIODE, PREISSCHILDSYSTEM, COMPUTERVORRICHTUNG UND SPEICHERUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ DE RÉGLAGE DE PÉRIODE D'ÉCOUTE DE TRAME, SYSTÈME D'ÉTIQUETTE DE PRIX, DISPOSITIF INFORMATIQUE ET STOCKAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">FRAME-LISTENING PERIOD ADJUSTMENT MEHTOD, PRICE TAG SYSTEM, COMPUTER DEVICE, AND STORAGE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present application provides a method for adjusting a frame-listening cycle, and a shelf label system. The shelf label system includes a server, a base station, and an electronic shelf label. The server is configured to: configure a fixed frame-listening cycle of the electronic shelf label, and send to the electronic shelf label at least one frame-listening cycle modification command through the base station. The fixed frame-listening cycle includes a fast frame-listening cycle and a low power consumption frame-listening cycle.</p>
            </abstract>
